# Pesara Limited

Read `CURSOR.md` before any product or code change.

Pesara Limited is a technology venture studio. It is not a software agency, a loan app, a wallet, or the previous boda companion product.

Proposition: You bring the idea. We bring the technology. We build the business together.

Pesara evaluates ideas, validates commercial viability, designs the business, builds the technology, launches the product, and may partner through fees, revenue share, equity, licensing, or another written agreement.

Do not invent production portfolio achievements, fake metrics, or ownership claims. Zero counts show early-stage messaging. Human review is mandatory for venture decisions. Never expose service-role keys.

Every public page should leave a visitor thinking: "I have an idea. I should send it to Pesara."
